s)", "shown": {"message": "The answer to `experiment-repo`#4 covers the venue's checklist items on statistical significance, compute, licences and LLM use. Its code package is about 7 MB, well under the 100 MB ZIP limit.\n\nI commented on the issue with two points for the package:\n- **Licences:** the MIT licence covers only the data repo's own files. Each underlying benchmark should be named with the source it was taken from, and the comment says only binary outcomes are used. They should not claim a licence they didn't check.\n- **Anonymity:** the `code/` tree and its README must carry no author, institution or non-anonymous URL, since a violation is a desk rejection.\n\nI found no other gap. I made no repository changes this turn and left `experiment-repo`#4 open for them to close."}}, {"id": "f2f07e05-ffe8-5c5e-a5a6-aee9baf1e22d", "at": 1795676110.8312447, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 20525, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "d50b760bd4386c2bd0eb94b03cfb873f", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "be58aa17-cb4e-5328-9ded-1c26654d38f1", "at": 1795676110.8348186, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 20526, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "d50b760bd4386c2bd0eb94b03cfb873f", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": "end_turn", "label": "message → end_turn", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "response"}, {"id": "dfcecbe8-02d1-541d-b3a7-f0ceb798b886", "at": 1795676110.8470259, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 20527, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session_info_update", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "d50b760bd4386c2bd0eb94b03cfb873f", "trust": "agent-